Stem Cogent v2 database migrations
==================================

Run Alembic from the backend directory so that alembic.ini is discovered:

    alembic current
    alembic upgrade head

The environment reads DATABASE_URL for local development and CI. In ECS it
uses DATABASE_HOST plus DATABASE_CREDENTIALS_ARN through the same settings and
Secrets Manager path as the API service. The resolved URL is never stored in
alembic.ini or logged.

The v2 baseline is the authoritative 0001-0010 sequence defined by
SC-DOC-003 v2 and SC-DOC-010 Stage 1.4. Migration files are immutable after
production application; corrections must be expressed as a new revision.
